---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' The dot pipeline writes the empty packages of the root before the other
' root entities, so Graphviz lays out P, A, B from left to right. Smetana must
' receive the same order: in the reference SVG the title "P" has the smallest
' x, then "A", then "B".
!pragma layout smetana
class A
class B
package P {
}
@enduml
